[36m(main_task pid=2959448)[0m Doc 1(Title: "Birth flower") Birth flower Each month has a flower that symbolizes the month of somebody's birth. The characteristics that the flower has may be ""inherited"" by whomever is born in that certain month person. Every month has a flower that is sometimes referred to as a Birth Month Flower. Flowers by month is a term describing flowers related to a recipient's birth month, and in general flowers associated with particular months of the year. It is one of a class of specialized categorizations offered by florists. In a cultural sense, flower characteristics such as appearance, color, and scent, have relevance as gifts.
